    "title": "2026 World Baseball Classic: How to watch the USA vs. Dominican Republic semifinal game tonight, where to stream and more",
    "text": "Story by 2026 World Baseball Classic: How to watch the USA vs. Dominican Republic semifinal game tonight, where to stream and more If you buy something through a link in this article, we may earn commission. Danica Creahan Streaming Editor Mon, March 16, 2026 at 12:03 AM UTC · 1 min read Team USA has advanced past the quarterfinals at the World Baseball Classic and will now face the Dominican Republic in the semifinals this Sunday. The USA vs. Dominican Republic semifinal game will air on Fox and FOX Deportes tonight at 8 p.m. ET. The game will also stream on FOX One. Here's everything you need to know about how to watch the 2026 World Baseball Classic, including the full schedule and where to watch. Where to watch the USA vs. Dominican Republic semifinal at the 2026 World Baseball Classic Watch every game on FOX One FOX One Try free at Amazon Watch Fox and Fox Deportes DirecTV Try free at DirecTV Date: Sunday, March 15 Advertisement Advertisement Advertisement Time: 8 p.m. ET Channels: Fox, Fox Deportes Streaming: FOX One, DirecTV , Fubo & more USA vs. Dominican Republic semifinal game time: The Dominican Republic vs. USA game at the World Baseball Classic will take place tonight, March 15, at 8 p.m. ET. USA vs. Dominican Republic semifinal game channel: The USA vs. Dominican Republic game will be broadcast live on Fox and in Spanish on FOX Deportes. Where to watch the World Baseball Classic without cable Every single World Baseball Classic game will stream on FOX One. You can also catch games that are broadcast on Fox, FS1 and FS2 on platforms like DirecTV and Fubo. Watch every game on FOX One FOX One FOX One is a new streaming service from FOX that launched in 2025. With a subscription to FOX One, you can tune in to all your favorite FOX channels like FOX News, FOX Sports, FOX Weather, FS1, FS2, FOX Business, FOX Deportes, Big Ten Network (B1G), and local FOX stations all in one place, and this year, they'll be streaming every single game of the 2026 World Baseball Classic. FOX One offers live programming, as well as shows and movies on demand. The base price for FOX One will cost $19.99 a month, or you can save with an annual subscription for $199.99. $19.99/month at FOX Explore More Buying Options Try free at Amazon Watch Fox and more DirecTV Try free at DirecTV Watch Fox on Fubo Fubo TV Try Free at Fubo Watch Fox on Hulu Hulu + Live TV Try free for 3 days at Hulu World Baseball Classic Schedule Sunday, March 15, 2026 United States @ Dominican Republic: 8:00 PM ET (FOX, FS1) Monday, March 16, 2026 Venezuela @ Italy: 8:00 PM ET (FS1) Tuesday, March 17, 2026 TBD @ TBD: 8:00 PM ET (FOX) Advertisement Advertisement",
